---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/layout/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Sajal Choudhary - Personal" 
  description="Learn more about Sajal Choudhary - personal background, interests, and experiences" 
  currentPage="/sajal/"
  pageWrapper={{
    maxWidth: '7xl',
    padding: 'md',
    centered: true
  }}
  enableSearchModal
  enableLinkHoverEffect
>
  <PageHeader 
    title="Sajal Choudhary"
    description="Learn more about my background, interests, and experiences."
    layout="centered"
    size="lg"
    maxWidth="7xl"
  />
  
  <div class="prose dark:prose-dark mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 my-8">
      <div class="md:w-1/3">
        <img 
          src="/profile/profile.jpeg" 
          alt="Sajal Choudhary" 
          class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full aspect-square object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      
      <div class="md:w-2/3">
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          Hello! I'm Sajal Choudhary, a passionate individual who believes in continuous learning and sharing knowledge through writing and creative expression.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-4">
          I'm deeply interested in technology, literature, philosophy, and the intersection of human creativity with digital tools. This website serves as my digital garden—a space where I cultivate ideas, document my learning journey, and share insights with others.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-4">
          When I'm not writing or exploring new technologies, you can find me reading books, experimenting with creative writing, or engaging in thoughtful conversations about the future of digital content and human expression.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Personal Background Section -->
    <h2>Background & Journey</h2>
    
    <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark rounded-lg p-6 mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">My Story</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">
        I started my journey in the digital world around 2012, during my college years. What began as a simple Blogger site has evolved into this comprehensive digital platform that reflects my growth, interests, and the changing landscape of web technologies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over the years, I've experimented with various platforms and technologies, always seeking the right balance between functionality, performance, and creative freedom. This journey has taught me valuable lessons about web development, content management, and the importance of building systems that serve both creators and readers.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Interests Section -->
    <h2>Interests & Passions</h2>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">💻</span> Technology
        </h3>
        <p>
          Exploring emerging technologies, web development, and how digital tools can enhance human creativity and productivity.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">📚</span> Reading & Learning
        </h3>
        <p>
          Avid reader across various genres, from technical books to philosophy, fiction, and everything in between.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">✍️</span> Writing
        </h3>
        <p>
          Creative writing, technical documentation, and exploring different forms of expression through words.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">🌱</span> Digital Gardening
        </h3>
        <p>
          Cultivating a space for interconnected thoughts, ideas, and knowledge that grows and evolves over time.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">🎨</span> Creative Expression
        </h3>
        <p>
          Exploring various forms of creativity, from poetry and stories to visual design and digital art.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">🤝</span> Community
        </h3>
        <p>
          Building connections with like-minded individuals and contributing to meaningful discussions and knowledge sharing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Writing Philosophy Section -->
    <h2>Writing Philosophy</h2>
    
    <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark rounded-lg p-6 mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Why I Write</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">
        I believe that writing is one of the most powerful tools for thinking, learning, and connecting with others. Every piece I write serves multiple purposes:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Clarifying thoughts:</strong> Writing helps me understand complex ideas and concepts better</li>
        <li><strong>Sharing knowledge:</strong> Documenting what I learn so others can benefit from my experiences</li>
        <li><strong>Creative expression:</strong> Exploring ideas through different forms of writing</li>
        <li><strong>Building community:</strong> Connecting with people who share similar interests and perspectives</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Current Focus Section -->
    <h2>Current Focus</h2>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">🚀</span> Active Projects
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>• Maintaining and improving this digital garden</li>
          <li>• Writing regular content across different categories</li>
          <li>• Exploring new technologies and frameworks</li>
          <li>• Building a sustainable content creation workflow</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">📖</span> Learning Goals
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>• Deepening understanding of web technologies</li>
          <li>• Improving creative writing skills</li>
          <li>• Exploring new content formats and mediums</li>
          <li>• Building better systems for knowledge management</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Personal Timeline Section -->
    <h2>Personal Timeline</h2>
    
    <div class="timeline-container relative border-l border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark ml-4 md:ml-0 pl-8 md:pl-0 mb-12">
      <div class="timeline-wrapper grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_3fr] gap-4 md:gap-8">
        <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2025</span>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Digital Garden Evolution</h3>
            <p>Rebuilt the website using Astro, focusing on performance, user experience, and creating a more interconnected knowledge base. This represents a significant step forward in my digital presence and content strategy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2021-2024</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2021-2024</span>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Content Creation Focus</h3>
            <p>Focused on building a consistent writing habit and developing my voice across different content types. Explored various platforms and learned valuable lessons about content management and audience engagement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 3 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2018-2020</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2018-2020</span>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Professional Growth</h3>
            <p>Developed deeper technical skills and began exploring the intersection of technology and creativity. Started thinking more seriously about building a personal brand and digital presence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2012-2018</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2012-2018</span>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Early Digital Exploration</h3>
            <p>Started my first blog during college, experimenting with different platforms and content types. This period laid the foundation for my interest in digital content creation and web technologies.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Contact & Connect Section -->
    <h2>Connect With Me</h2>
    
    <p class="mb-4">
      I'm always interested in connecting with like-minded individuals, discussing ideas, and collaborating on interesting projects. Feel free to reach out through any of the following channels:
    </p>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Professional</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/yourusername" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sajal Choudhary</a></li>
          <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/yourusername" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@yourusername</a></li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:your.email@example.com">your.email@example.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Social & Content</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Twitter:</strong> <a href="https://twitter.com/yourusername" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@yourusername</a></li>
          <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> <a href="/nordletter/">Nordletter</a></li>
          <li><strong>RSS:</strong> <a href="/feeds/">All Feeds</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark rounded-lg p-6 mt-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Let's Connect</h3>
      <p class="text-textSecondary dark:text-textColorDark">
        Whether you want to discuss a topic I've written about, collaborate on a project, or just say hello, I'd love to hear from you. The best conversations often start with a simple message.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    /* Timeline specific styles */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .timeline-container {
        position: relative;
      }
      
      .timeline-container:before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 50%;
        width: 2px;
        background-color: var(--color-border);
        transform: translateX(-1px);
      }
    }
    
    .timeline-marker {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--color-bg);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>